{"chars": "In the spring, Blitzen's old antlers loosened and fell off, one and then the other, clunk and clunk, into the straw. It didn't hurt her one bit. All reindeer shed their antlers every year. The elves carried them carefully up the seashell stairs to the Antler Archive, and gave them a little card of their own. And right away, Blitzen began to grow new ones: two soft, fuzzy little knobs at first, covered in a velvety brown skin, that grew a little bigger every single day.", "start": [0.275, 0.275, 0.362, 0.362, 0.362, 0.362, 0.45, 0.45, 0.45, 0.45, 0.45, 0.45, 0.45, 0.825, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 1.35, 1.35, 1.35, 1.35, 1.6, 1.6, 1.6, 1.6, 1.6, 1.6, 1.6, 1.6, 2.05, 2.05, 2.05, 2.05, 2.05, 2.05, 2.05, 2.05, 2.05, 2.475, 2.475, 2.475, 2.475, 2.612, 2.612, 2.612, 2.612, 2.612, 2.875, 2.875, 2.875, 2.875, 3.425, 3.525, 3.525, 3.525, 3.525, 3.712, 3.712, 3.712, 3.712, 3.812, 3.812, 3.812, 3.812, 3.812, 3.962, 3.962, 3.962, 3.962, 4.075, 4.075, 4.075, 4.075, 4.075, 4.075, 4.4, 4.513, 4.513, 4.513, 4.513, 4.513, 4.513, 4.875, 4.875, 4.875, 4.875, 5.013, 5.013, 5.013, 5.013, 5.013, 5.013, 5.35, 5.412, 5.412, 5.412, 5.412, 5.412, 5.612, 5.612, 5.612, 5.612, 5.713, 5.713, 5.713, 5.713, 5.713, 5.713, 6.525, 6.625, 6.625, 6.625, 6.737, 6.737, 6.737, 6.737, 6.737, 6.737, 6.737, 6.95, 6.95, 6.95, 6.95, 6.95, 7.188, 7.188, 7.188, 7.188, 7.3, 7.3, 7.3, 7.3, 7.525, 7.525, 7.525, 7.525, 8.05, 8.15, 8.15, 8.15, 8.15, 8.375, 8.375, 8.375, 8.375, 8.375, 8.375, 8.375, 8.375, 8.375, 8.838, 8.838, 8.838, 8.838, 8.838, 9.075, 9.075, 9.075, 9.075, 9.075, 9.075, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.275, 9.725, 9.725, 9.725, 9.725, 9.725, 9.725, 10.05, 10.05, 10.05, 10.05, 10.05, 10.7, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.8, 10.95, 10.95, 10.95, 10.95, 10.95, 10.95, 11.25, 11.25, 11.25, 11.25, 11.25, 11.25, 11.25, 11.25, 11.562, 11.562, 11.562, 11.562, 11.562, 11.762, 11.762, 11.762, 11.762, 11.762, 11.762, 11.762, 11.762, 11.762, 11.762, 12.